1
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,100
"Kiss Or Kill"

2
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
(Episode 7)

3
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:21,040
Listen to me.

4
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,079
I'm his brother.

5
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,760
Brother?

6
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:26,879
What are you laughing at?

7
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:28,439
At how naive you are.

8
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:30,640
The ones who do this to you

9
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,840
are your own brothers.

10
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:34,719
You still think it's funny?

11
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,920
Don't be afraid.

12
00:01:49,159 --> 00:01:51,399
After all, you're Brother
Yan's good friend.

13
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,879
I won't hurt you.

14
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,718
This is just a little something

15
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:55,958
to help you loosen your tongue.

16
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:57,000
It's good stuff.

17
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,040
Second Uncle.

18
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,000
Even though the drug didn't work,

19
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,800
we still can't trust this guy.

20
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,319
Black Scorpion,

21
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:22,759
before the deal with the
Black Moon Society is done,

22
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:25,120
you can't touch A-yan.

23
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,599
And Nie Chuan can't die either.

24
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,039
Why not?

25
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:30,680
Second Uncle, we've been running

26
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,680
that route for years,

27
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,159
and it gets shut down just like that.

28
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,239
As soon as Nie Chuan shows up,

29
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,376
a new route magically appears.

30
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,319
Don't you think that's
a little too convenient?

31
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,638
The military route got cut off.

32
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:41,560
You can't blame that on him.

33
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,959
Besides, he has a new route in his hands.

34
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,680
If it's useful, we keep him around for now.

35
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,918
As for whether he's friend or foe,

36
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:48,960
what's the rush?

37
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,240
Second Uncle,

38
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,159
I'm just worried that you...

39
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,800
You don't need to worry about this.

40
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,199
Send your men

41
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,560
to look into Nie Chuan's background.

42
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:00,400
The more detailed, the better.

43
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,800
Yes, Second Uncle.

44
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,800
Time to eat.

45
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,960
It still hurts. I can't stand up.

46
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:29,759
Eat.

47
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,360
My hands hurt too. I can't lift them.

48
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,439
Feed me.

49
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,320
As long as you're not
afraid I'll poison you.

50
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,959
It's your first time cooking?

51
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,560
Tastes pretty good.

52
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,039
Even food can't shut you up.

53
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,639
Who is it?

54
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,598
You little bastard.

55
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:07,439
I've dug up everything on you this time.

56
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:09,199
Not this again.

57
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:11,159
You used to be in the government army.

58
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,318
You were kicked out for insubordination,

59
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,536
and that's why you became a mercenary.

60
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,560
Right?

61
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:16,160
You work fast, Brother Scorpion.

62
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,240
That's right.

63
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,560
I did.

64
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,639
So what?

65
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,399
You knew?

66
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:23,839
I knew.

67
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,518
You knew and you still trust him this much?

68
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,519
I don't.

69
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,920
That's why after the
incident with the shipment,

70
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,399
I've been investigating too.

71
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,560
And now I have evidence in my hands.

72
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:36,240
It's much more useful

73
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,000
than what you found.

74
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:40,576
I was just about to take
him to see Second Uncle.

75
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,600
Want to come along?

76
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,360
Want to come along?

77
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,519
Second Uncle.

78
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,239
I checked the surveillance footage.

79
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,079
The night before the delivery,

80
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,639
A-feng went into the warehouse.

81
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,680
What were you doing there?

82
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,120
I... I was just doing an inspection.

83
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,160
Since when do you have the authority

84
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,839
to inspect Second Uncle's goods?

85
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:20,519
Black Scorpion,

86
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:22,279
he's your man.

87
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,800
What should we do?

88
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:30,935
Brother Scorpion, please do
something, Brother Scorpion!

89
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:31,959
Second Uncle,

90
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:35,000
A-feng has been with me for years.

91
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,199
He couldn't have...

92
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:38,519
Second Uncle,

93
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,639
I didn't do anything!

94
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,079
I swear,

95
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,279
I didn't do anything!

96
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,759
I didn't ask what you did.

97
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:47,120
I asked what we should do.

98
00:06:00,839 --> 00:06:01,839
Brother Scorpion!

99
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:03,439
Please, you have to save me!

100
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,279
Whatever Second Uncle says,

101
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,439
goes.

102
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:14,839
I didn't do anything!

103
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:16,399
It was Scor... Scor...

104
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,519
Lin Yan.

105
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:31,000
I'm having a harder time figuring you out.

106
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,600
You've got another life on your hands.

107
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,879
What else was I supposed to do?

108
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:51,360
Send you to your death?

109
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,920
You set A-feng up.

110
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:57,480
First, you made Black Scorpion think

111
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:59,199
you had something to hide.

112
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:02,078
The more you tried to hide it,

113
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,240
the more he wanted to dig.

114
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,360
A-feng was obedient enough,

115
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,120
and stupid enough.

116
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:09,360
Now dead men tell no tales.

117
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,680
When the evidence was presented,

118
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:15,039
Black Scorpion had no
choice but to shut up.

119
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:17,680
He couldn't exactly
tell Lin Cang to his face

120
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,680
that he wanted to help you.

121
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,879
Lin Yan,

122
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,199
you're really something else.

123
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,120
Do you still dare to stay?

124
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,639
In this world,

125
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:42,439
not many people would
use themselves as bait.

126
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,360
Take a guess if I dare.

127
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,600
Stop wading into these muddy waters.

128
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:54,679
We were never on the
same path to begin with.

129
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:57,120
I can be.

130
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,639
I won't let the person I like lose.

131
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:12,319
Don't make promises so easily.

132
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,399
If I say it,

133
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:16,160
I'll definitely do it.

134
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,240
From today on,

135
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:19,439
count me in.

136
00:08:19,639 --> 00:08:21,120
You don't belong here.

137
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:25,360
Good thing I don't plan on leaving.

138
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:43,320
Okay, got it.

139
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,840
Coward.

140
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,120
Second Uncle.

141
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,639
Black Moon has replied.

142
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,600
The deal is still on.

143
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,319
For the security this time,

144
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,600
you'll be in full charge.

145
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:12,638
I'll have Nie Chuan coordinate the route.

146
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:13,960
We're not using his route.

147
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:16,679
Then...

148
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:17,960
Which route are we taking?

149
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,360
You don't need to worry about the route.

150
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:24,319
You just need to ensure the site is secure

151
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,559
during the transaction.

152
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,680
Which warehouse will the goods leave from?

153
00:09:28,772 --> 00:09:30,693
Any information you need to know,

154
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,200
I will tell you.

155
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:33,999
As for everything else,

156
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,080
don't ask.

157
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,639
Yes.

158
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:38,639
A-yan,

159
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:42,159
don't let me down.

160
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:55,759
The Black Moon Society agreed
to continue the deal so quickly.

161
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:56,919
Something's not right.

162
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,039
You think so too?

163
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:05,599
There was a problem with the last shipment.

164
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:07,120
Any normal buyer

165
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,399
would be suspicious.

166
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:10,398
But they're rushing to
close the deal instead.

167
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:10,960
Either

168
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,000
their demand is

169
00:10:12,001 --> 00:10:13,159
more urgent than we thought,

170
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:14,799
or

171
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:17,240
they're planning something big.

172
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,080
It could be a national-level war.

173
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,120
This deal cannot go through.

174
00:10:26,399 --> 00:10:27,399
What do you mean?

175
00:10:31,639 --> 00:10:32,759
This route is wrong.

176
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:34,000
The terrain is too flat.

177
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,879
It's wide open on both sides.

178
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:38,840
If we're ambushed, there's nowhere to hide.

179
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,679
Then where do you think

180
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,000
they'll go?

181
00:11:06,399 --> 00:11:07,839
You knew about this route all along.

182
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,559
Lin Cang put me in charge of security,

183
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:13,159
but won't let me touch the route.

184
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,720
He gave up on your route.

185
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:16,559
He doesn't trust you.

186
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,399
No.

187
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:21,960
It's because your route is too clean.

188
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,398
Too perfect.

189
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,360
Every single checkpoint

190
00:11:24,361 --> 00:11:25,559
is timed perfectly.

191
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,919
Every inspection station

192
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,518
is bypassed cleanly.

193
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,639
A perfect route

194
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:32,519
is the most suspicious route.

195
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,240
And Lin Cang

196
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,040
doesn't believe in perfection.

197
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:39,200
Do you?

198
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:45,799
I believe in you.

199
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,840
Brother Yan,

200
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,440
Father only wants you to go in alone.

201
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,799
Why is Brother Yan so good to you?

202
00:12:28,039 --> 00:12:30,159
Maybe because I'm just that good.

203
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,200
He's never brought an outsider back before.

204
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,240
Don't drag him down.

205
00:12:38,679 --> 00:12:40,120
I traded my life for his.

206
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:42,639
I'm more afraid of him
getting hurt than you are.

207
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:44,840
Even truth serum doesn't work on you.

208
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,919
You're no ordinary person.

209
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,559
I'm just a middleman.

210
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:51,039
Just making a quick buck.

211
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,679
Thank you, Second Uncle.

212
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,600
Thank you, Second Uncle.

213
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:06,519
A-yan.

214
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,519
Is everything arranged?

215
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Yes.

216
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,120
Black Scorpion.

217
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:14,759
Have your men

218
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:16,600
assist with security this time.

219
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,120
A-yan will be in charge
of deploying all personnel.

220
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,200
Second Uncle.

221
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,519
I've always managed my own men.

222
00:13:24,799 --> 00:13:26,158
This time is different.

223
00:13:26,159 --> 00:13:27,320
The deal is crucial.

224
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,679
We can't afford any slip-ups.

225
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,759
A-yan is in charge of the site.

226
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,720
Your men will take orders from him.

227
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:35,480
It'll be much more efficient this way.

228
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:37,639
But...

229
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,799
Are you questioning my arrangements?

230
00:13:44,879 --> 00:13:45,519
I wouldn't dare.

231
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:46,759
Then it's settled.

232
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:47,759
You can go now.

233
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:49,440
I still have things to discuss with A-yan.

234
00:13:58,679 --> 00:13:59,679
A-yan.

235
00:13:59,799 --> 00:14:02,000
I need you to keep a
close eye on this deal.

236
00:14:02,279 --> 00:14:03,558
As for Black Scorpion's men,

237
00:14:03,559 --> 00:14:04,559
use them as you see fit.

238
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,480
Replace anyone who doesn't follow orders.

239
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,519
We can't have another incident like A-feng.

240
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,000
Understood.

241
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,559
Understood. Go on.

242
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:14,840
Oh, right.

243
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,638
Once you're tired of your toys,

244
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:18,000
dispose of them cleanly.

245
00:14:19,759 --> 00:14:21,919
Don't let them interfere
with our real business.

246
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,360
Yes.

247
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:29,519
Yes.

248
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,399
I'll pay a visit in person.

249
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,120
There definitely won't
be any issues this time.

250
00:14:35,399 --> 00:14:36,399
Rest assured.

251
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,240
Got it, got it.

252
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,600
Second Uncle just said,

253
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,439
I can use your men as I see fit.

254
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,560
If they don't follow orders,

255
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:56,519
I should replace them.

256
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,600
Are you questioning my arrangements?

257
00:15:07,159 --> 00:15:08,240
I just think

258
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,720
you've followed Second
Uncle for so many years,

259
00:15:12,679 --> 00:15:14,080
you shouldn't be treated like this.

260
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:27,159
Brother Scorpion!
Brother Scorpion, save me!

261
00:15:27,559 --> 00:15:29,495
Second Uncle! Brother
Scorpion! Brother Scorpion!

262
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:31,119
A-feng has been with me for a long time.

263
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,840
He's heading out.

264
00:15:51,559 --> 00:15:52,559
Where to?

265
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:54,200
Before he left,

266
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,000
I heard him take a call.

267
00:15:56,559 --> 00:15:59,240
He sounded very cautious.

268
00:15:59,759 --> 00:16:01,559
There aren't many people

269
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,560
who can make him act that way.

270
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,999
Over the years, your goods

271
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,096
have always found a way out.

272
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,520
Everything has been smooth sailing.

273
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:08,999
Does really no one know

274
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,320
who's backing him?

275
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,278
He never lets anyone

276
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:13,479
get close to that information.

277
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,798
I've investigated for years,

278
00:16:15,799 --> 00:16:16,559
but I still have no idea

279
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,720
who the mastermind is.

280
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:19,359
This is the first time

281
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,720
we have a chance to tail him.

282
00:16:21,559 --> 00:16:24,696
It seems it's not just the Black Moon
Syndicate that's anxious this time.

283
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,720
He's anxious too.

284
00:16:26,279 --> 00:16:27,399
Or rather,

285
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:29,119
the person backing him is anxious.

286
00:16:30,639 --> 00:16:31,639
If

287
00:16:32,399 --> 00:16:33,719
he's going to meet

288
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,039
the person on the phone,

289
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,320
then that means

290
00:16:36,559 --> 00:16:37,559
this person

291
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:39,158
is the real power

292
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,720
behind Lin Cang.

293
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:46,039
Are you coming along?

294
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:48,039
Obviously.

295
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:51,039
Alright.

296
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,480
Let's switch cars.

297
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,639
Mine is too flashy.

298
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,360
Looks like this is the place.

299
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,480
Yeah.

300
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,519
He noticed us.

301
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:20,799
Don't move.

302
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,160
Follow my lead.

303
00:17:42,119 --> 00:17:43,359
Just a couple of lovebirds.

304
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:48,319
They're gone.

305
00:17:50,319 --> 00:17:51,558
You're getting bolder by the minute.

306
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:53,335
Stop messing around.
Let's get down to business.

307
00:17:53,359 --> 00:17:55,759
This is exactly the business
I want to get down to.

308
00:18:18,319 --> 00:18:20,216
You really don't know
how to prioritize, do you?

309
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,600
I know my priorities all too well.

310
00:18:21,799 --> 00:18:23,000
That's why I waited until now.

311
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:25,039
The priority right now is

312
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:28,440
figuring out who Lin Cang went
to such great lengths to meet.

313
00:18:28,599 --> 00:18:29,599
Song Peng.

314
00:18:30,799 --> 00:18:31,799
Song Peng?

315
00:18:31,939 --> 00:18:33,219
Deputy Minister of Defense?

316
00:18:33,893 --> 00:18:36,652
This is the secret rendezvous spot
General Song Peng gave to his mistress.

317
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,160
I've been here before.

318
00:18:38,359 --> 00:18:39,359
You've been here?

319
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,239
I had a mission before

320
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,679
that required me to get acquainted

321
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,775
with General Song Peng's mistress.

322
00:18:44,799 --> 00:18:45,799
Right here.

323
00:18:47,279 --> 00:18:48,279
Acquainted?

324
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,279
A mission?

325
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:53,919
How did you get acquainted?

326
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,160
Dressed up as a plumber?

327
00:18:55,799 --> 00:18:57,879
Played the hero saving
the damsel in distress? Or...

328
00:18:58,279 --> 00:18:59,680
I don't rely on those

329
00:18:59,799 --> 00:19:00,799
cheap tricks.

330
00:19:02,519 --> 00:19:03,639
So you're saying

331
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:06,680
you spent a romantic
night with this mistress?

332
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,039
Not exactly.

333
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,480
Something came up,

334
00:19:10,519 --> 00:19:11,519
and I was called away.

335
00:19:13,519 --> 00:19:14,519
What a pity.

336
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,720
Where are we going?

337
00:19:18,039 --> 00:19:19,039
To change clothes.

338
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,136
It's too far to go back to your place.

339
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,359
Let's just rest here for now.

340
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,600
We'll figure it out tomorrow.

341
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,079
You used to live here?

342
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,000
One of them.

343
00:19:52,839 --> 00:19:56,160
Seems like you have quite a few hideouts.

344
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:07,960
I know what you're thinking.

345
00:20:09,519 --> 00:20:11,599
I don't care who's backing him

346
00:20:12,079 --> 00:20:13,319
or how powerful they are.

347
00:20:13,799 --> 00:20:15,240
As long as he's in your way,

348
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:17,039
I have ways to make him disappear.

349
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,119
But this power

350
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,559
is beyond what we previously imagined.

351
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,159
Song Peng.

352
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:29,000
Deputy Minister of Defense. A general.

353
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,240
Don't underestimate me.

354
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,799
Who knows,

355
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,720
I might be able to help you

356
00:20:36,039 --> 00:20:37,880
much more than you think.

357
00:20:41,119 --> 00:20:42,359
I know you're capable.

358
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,440
If you wanted to,

359
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,600
you could take Lin Cang's life at any time.

360
00:20:49,319 --> 00:20:51,799
But even if Lin Cang dies,

361
00:20:52,599 --> 00:20:54,240
as long as Song Peng is still around,

362
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,960
there will be a second Lin Cang tomorrow.

363
00:20:57,559 --> 00:20:58,759
And a third.

364
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:07,799
Then...

365
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,559
will you be the next Lin Cang?

366
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:10,720
No.

367
00:21:10,839 --> 00:21:11,920
Then there you have it.

368
00:21:12,759 --> 00:21:13,839
As long as it's not you,

369
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,519
I'll kill all the rest.
